window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>– From Kindle Storyteller Award Winner G J Ogden –<br> <br> <b>When dragons wake, kingdoms burn.</b><br> <br> Sir Torin Cadwell is a knight torn between blood and duty. He’s the tyrant king’s illegitimate son, yet sworn protector of the realm. Bound by blood to an ancient feud with Kyhrax, the most feared dragon in all of Westskyr, Torin must walk a razor’s edge between servant and heir.<br> <br> For centuries, the crystallized heart of Astreya, the Great Mother dragon, has shielded the realm from destruction. But when the sacred sword Astreya’s Lament is stolen, the magical barrier crumbles. Ancient drakes stir in their slumber. A vengeful dragon cult rises from the shadows. And the fire of draconic wrath threatens to consume all seven realms.<br> <br> From besieged battlements to the edge of the known world, Torin faces a relentless cult determined to reshape Westskyr through dragon might. Former enemies become unlikely allies. Ancient powers awaken. And one outcast knight must save seven realms from total destruction.</p> <p><b>Perfect for fans of Brandon Sanderson and John Gwynne who crave epic battles, legendary weapons, and dragons that make the earth tremble. Binge the complete saga today and discover why readers can’t put down the Hearts of Dragons trilogy.</b><br> <br> <b>This complete trilogy includes:</b></p> <ol> <li>Sword of the Fallen</li> <li>Queen of the Forest</li> <li>Heart of Stone</li> </ol>"; 
